WEBVTT

00:05:59.772 --> 00:06:02.149
(Laughter)

00:06:02.191 --> 00:06:05.111
This is not the Lying Liar show.

00:06:05.528 --> 00:06:09.448
It is the Slightly Annoying
but Ultimately Lovable Tall Vegan show.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:11.784
(Laughter)

00:06:11.784 --> 00:06:17.164
So today we are going to be making
a snack that happens to be vegan,

00:06:17.206 --> 00:06:19.166
happens to be great for the planet,

00:06:19.208 --> 00:06:21.877
happens to use one
of my favorite ingredients.

00:06:21.877 --> 00:06:25.005
We are making sweet and salty kelp chips,

00:06:25.005 --> 00:06:28.134
a Korean snack known as Dasima Twigak.

00:06:29.385 --> 00:06:30.886
Oh, thank you.